# tool::brew-name::comment

# macOS shell UX helpers
terminal-notifier::terminal-notifier::Send macOS notifications from the CLI
hs::hammerspoon::Automation tool for macOS
im-select::im-select::Switch macOS input source from CLI

# IDE / editor (host GUI; provides CLI entrypoints)
code::visual-studio-code::VS Code editor (installs `code` / `code-tunnel`)

# API / network debugging (power tools)
mitmproxy::mitmproxy::Intercept and inspect HTTP(S) traffic

# System / performance deep dive
mactop::mactop::Apple Silicon Monitor Top
